Package: ctdqc
Title: Shared CTD QC, Cleaning, and ERDDAP Ingestion Utilities
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Tylar", "Murray", email = "murray.tylar@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Shared utilities for discovering and downloading SFER MBON CTD
    casts from GCOOS ERDDAP, applying IOOS QARTOD quality-control flags, and
    cleaning casts with the oce package (ctdTrim/ctdDecimate). Extracted from
    the previously-duplicated implementations in sfer-mbon-oxygen and
    sfer-mbon-ctd-viz so both repos, and future consumers, share one
    implementation instead of drifting copies.
License: MIT
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.2
Imports:
    dplyr,
    here,
    oce
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
